I declare to be aware that:
I may change my Basic Contribution percentage at any time, determined in multiples of 0.5%;
On the enrollment date for the Natura &Co Group Benefit Plan, I must choose the Basic Contribution percentage. If I do not make my choice, the percentage of 0% (zero percent) will be considered;
The amount of the Basic Contribution will change when there is a change in my Contribution Salary or UR;
The Additional Contribution will correspond to a percentage freely chosen by the Participant in multiples of 0.5%;
The Basic Contribution will be made 12 times a year and the Additional Contribution can be made in the same month or in the month immediately preceding the one in which the Contribution determined in multiples of 0.5% is to be collected and at a freely chosen frequency;
There will be no counterpart from the Sponsor for the Additional Contribution;
Contribution deductions will be made on the payroll and, if not deducted from the payroll, I must pay the respective amounts to Nossa Prev or at a bank indicated by it, by the 10th (tenth) business day of the month following the month of competence;
The Contributions will continue to be deducted in case of receipt, by the Sponsor, of complementing sickness or accident aid;
The total Account balance will be allocated to the Profile chosen by the Participant;
I may change the option for the Investment Portfolio chosen for allocation of the Total Account balance in the months of June and December of each year, to be effective in the accrual month subsequent to the option. In the event that I do not change my option, the resources related to my Total Account balance will be kept in the last option made;
Nossa Prev will carry out the transfer of funds within 60 (sixty) days from the date of my option, considering the balance placed in the month preceding the transfer;
After granting the Benefit of Continuous Benefit, the possibility of choosing one of the Investment Portfolios will be maintained in accordance with the month and conditions mentioned in the items above and;
In the event of my death, the resources will be kept in the Investment Portfolio chosen by me until the end of the financial year of my death, and in the following years, the choice of the Investment Portfolio in which the Total account will be invested.
